<https://github.com/john1hsu/chess-graph/id/caro-kann-defence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A semi-open defence to 1.e4 in which Black plays 1...c6 to prepare ...d5, challenging White's centre while keeping a sound pawn structure and, in many lines, developing the light-squared bishop before playing ...e6." .
