<https://github.com/john1hsu/chess-graph/id/game-tree-search> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The family of methods by which a program chooses a move by exploring the tree of positions reachable from the current one, where nodes are positions, edges are moves and each level is a ply; in chess the tree is far too large to explore fully, so searches are cut off and guided." .
