<https://github.com/john1hsu/chess-graph/id/horizon-effect> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The class of misjudgements a depth-limited game-tree search makes because it cannot see past its maximum search depth: it may push an unavoidable loss just beyond that horizon and believe it avoided, or grab a gain too early because its consequences lie out of sight." .
